From: dengbaowen <dengbaowen@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: rk3528-mangopi-m28k: add AIC8800 bluetooth over uart2

M28K 板载 AIC8800 (SDIO WiFi + UART BT)。内核 6.1 vendor 已自带
drivers/bluetooth/hci_aic.c (serdev, of_match "cvte,aic8800-bt"),
只需在 &uart2 下挂 serdev 子节点, 并把 RTS 纳入 pinctrl
(hci_aic 的 aic_open() 要求 hci_uart_has_flow_control, 缺 RTS 会直接失败)。

写法参照同平台 rk3528-nanopi-rev03.dts。BT wake gpio 与 R28S 同为 gpio1 RK_PB4
(同一参考设计)。

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-mangopi-m28k.dts | 10 +++++++++-
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-mangopi-m28k.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-mangopi-m28k.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-mangopi-m28k.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-mangopi-m28k.dts
@@ -756,7 +756,12 @@
 &uart2 {
 	status = "okay";
 	pinctrl-names = "default";
-	pinctrl-0 = <&uart2m1_xfer &uart2m1_ctsn>;
+	pinctrl-0 = <&uart2m1_xfer &uart2m1_ctsn &uart2m1_rtsn>;
+
+	bluetooth {
+		compatible = "cvte,aic8800-bt";
+		device-wake-gpios = <&gpio1 RK_PB4 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
+	};
 };
 
 &uart3 {
